# What is EDA?

EDA means

> **Exploring data before modeling.**

Typical workflow

```text
Read Dataset
      ↓
Inspect Data
      ↓
Statistics
      ↓
Find Missing Values
      ↓
Find Outliers
      ↓
Find Relationships
      ↓
Machine Learning
```

---

# 11.1 count() ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Returns the number of **non-missing values**.

```python
