# Detecting Outliers Using IQR

Suppose

Salary

```text
50000

55000

60000

65000

500000
```

Clearly

```text
500000
```

is an outlier.

---

Step 1

```python
Q1 = df["Salary"].quantile(0.25)

Q3 = df["Salary"].quantile(0.75)
```

---

Step 2

```python
IQR = Q3 - Q1
```

---

Step 3

Lower Bound

```python
lower = Q1 - 1.5 * IQR
```

Upper Bound

```python
upper = Q3 + 1.5 * IQR
```

---

Step 4

```python
outliers = df[
    (df["Salary"] < lower) |
    (df["Salary"] > upper)
]
```

Very common in EDA.

